# Test-tree narrowings.  Inherits the root `.clang-tidy` and turns off
# exactly two checks whose findings here are all generated by Catch2
# macros rather than written by anyone.  Both stay enabled for `src/`.
#
# -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization (107 findings, 107 in tests)
#   Every one is the static registrar `TEST_CASE` expands to
#   (`dummyUser1`, `dummyUser3`, …).  Catch2 has no non-static
#   registration form, so the only way to satisfy the check is to stop
#   using the test framework.
#
# -readability-function-cognitive-complexity (22 findings in tests)
#   Catch2 nests every `SECTION` and `REQUIRE` inside the `TEST_CASE`
#   body, so the metric counts framework nesting, not anything a reader
#   has to hold in their head.  A test with six sections trips the
#   threshold while being entirely linear to read.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity
